# AgToosa Review Rules

When executing `/agtoosa-review` or any review work, follow `Docs/AgToosa_Review.md` precisely.

## Key constraints

- All 4 specialist personas (Security Officer, Engineering Manager, CEO/PO, QA Lead) must complete before shipping.
- Any 🔴 Critical finding blocks the ship — do not proceed to `/agtoosa-ship` until all are resolved.
- The Simplifier pass is not optional — always refactor the top 3 complex sections.
- Apply the Iron Law root-cause protocol for every failing test or bug found during review.
- Update `Docs/Master-Plan.md` with review status after each run.
- **IDE Host Mode Bridge:** prefer native IDE plan mode for persona/findings synthesis; switch to Agent/Auto at briefing complete per `Docs/AgToosa_AgentCapability.md` → **IDE Host Mode Matrix** (Cursor row). Print `HOST-MODE: plan complete → switching to agent for AgToosa artifacts` before writing `review-*.md`. Include `### Plan-Mode Review Briefing (findings)` in every review report.
- **Cross-model:** Read `Docs/Context/workflow.md` (`cross_model`, `reviewer_model`); print the consent line before reviewer subagents; never upgrade reviewer model above the parent session without explicit user approval.
